@startuml 09_liveness_record

skinparam nodesep 15
skinparam ranksep 25

usecase "start" as start_node
usecase " " as n1
usecase " " as n2
usecase " " as n3
usecase "d(record)" as n4
usecase "u(record)" as n5
usecase " " as n6
usecase "u(record)" as n7
usecase " " as n8
usecase " " as n9
usecase "u(record)" as n10
usecase " " as n11
usecase "u(record)" as n12
usecase " " as n13
usecase " " as n14
usecase " " as n15
usecase " " as n16
usecase " " as n17
usecase " " as n18
usecase " " as n19
usecase " " as n20
usecase " " as n21
usecase " " as n22
usecase " " as n23
usecase "Exit" as end_node
note right of end_node : k(record)

start_node --> n1
n1 --> n2
n2 --> n3 : True
n2 --> n4 : False
n3 --> end_node
n4 --> n5
n5 --> n6 : True
n5 --> n7 : False
n6 --> end_node
n7 --> n8 : True
n7 --> n10 : False
n8 --> n9
n9 --> end_node
n10 --> n11 : True
n10 --> n12 : False
n11 --> end_node
n12 --> n13 : True
n12 --> n14 : False
n13 --> end_node
n14 --> n15
n15 --> n16
n16 --> n17 : True
n16 --> n18 : False
n17 --> end_node
n18 --> n19
n19 --> n20
n20 --> n21
n21 --> n22
n22 --> n23
n23 --> end_node

@enduml

' Báo cáo kịch bản record:
' - Biến record được định nghĩa tại node 4: d(record)
' - Biến record được sử dụng tại node 5, 7, 10, 12: u(record)
' - Biến record bị hủy tại node Exit: k(record)
' - Chuỗi thao tác:
'   - Path 2: d(4) -> u(5) -> k(Exit) (Hợp lệ)
'   - Path 3: d(4) -> u(5) -> u(7) -> k(Exit) (Hợp lệ)
'   - Path 4: d(4) -> u(5) -> u(7) -> u(10) -> k(Exit) (Hợp lệ)
'   - Path 7: d(4) -> u(5) -> u(7) -> u(10) -> u(12) -> k(Exit) (Hợp lệ)
' Kết luận: Tính hợp lệ của biến record được đảm bảo (không có lỗi ~d, ~u, ~k).
